# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Lovable's territory — Prettier keeps its hands off it.
#
# Lovable (gpt-engineer-app[bot]) writes the UI layer and does not follow this
# repo's prettier.config.js: its files come back 5–20 lines away from what
# Prettier would produce. Formatting them on our side rewrites lines Lovable is
# about to rewrite too, which is how a design change turns into a merge
# conflict over nothing.
#
# So the split is the same one CLAUDE.md draws for ownership: the UI layer is
# Lovable's and stays formatted however Lovable writes it, while src/server,
# src/lib, supabase and scripts are ours and stay Prettier-clean. `npm run
# format` and `npm run check` both honour this list, so neither can drag a
# Lovable file into our diff by accident.
#
# If Lovable takes over another component, add it here — the three below are
# the ones it has actually been editing.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
src/routes/
src/integrations/
src/components/CookieConsent.tsx
src/components/SeatPicker.tsx
src/components/ThemeToggle.tsx
